{{!
    Follow-up suggestions below a result: an optional message and one button per suggestion; clicking a
    button sends its query as the next message. A skill provides them in its result (suggestions,
    followupmessage).

    Rendered by aiinstructions.js as its own assistant bubble.

    @template bookingextension_agent/followup_options

    @package    bookingextension_agent
    @copyright  2026 Wunderbyte GmbH <info@wunderbyte.at>
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Context variables required for this template:
    * message - Optional text above the buttons (may be empty).
    * suggestions - List of suggestions, each with:
      * query - The text that is sent when the button is clicked (also the tooltip).
      * label - The button text.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "message": "What would you like to do next?",
        "suggestions": [
            {"query": "Show the bookings of this option", "label": "Show bookings"},
            {"query": "Book Anna into this option", "label": "Book Anna"}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="booking-ai-followup-options mt-3 p-3 border rounded bg-light">
    {{#message}}<div class="font-weight-bold mb-2">{{message}}</div>{{/message}}
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap">
        {{#suggestions}}
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary mr-2 mb-2 booking-ai-followup-option" data-query="{{query}}" title="{{query}}">{{label}}</button>
        {{/suggestions}}
    </div>
</div>
